<main>

<!-- 1. Hero -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero__media">
    <picture class="hero__plate">
      <source media="(min-width: 1900px)" srcset="{{ 'cshop-hero-wide.webp' | asset_url }}" type="image/webp">
      <img src="{{ 'cshop-hero-tall.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A sugar-coated Dandy Mixed Berry gummy on a candy counter with berry syrup and the Dandy pouch behind it" width="1600" height="1986" fetchpriority="high">
    </picture>
    <img class="hero__giant" src="{{ 'cshop-hero-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1200" height="970" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="hero__sparkles" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <h1>Kratom that tastes like candy.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">Soft, sugar-coated Mixed Berry Gummies for the days you want a more enjoyable way to lift, focus, or settle into the moment.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--lg" href="#offer">Try Mixed Berry Gummies</a>
      <img class="hero__candy" src="{{ 'cshop-cta-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="140" height="140" aria-hidden="true">
    </div>
    <p class="hero__trust"><span>21+ only</span><span>Batch tested</span><span>30-day money-back guarantee</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. Flavor proof -->
<section class="flavor" id="flavor">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flavor__head">
      <h2>No powder mouth. No bitter chaser. No mixing ceremony.</h2>
      <p>Just a soft, sugar-coated Mixed Berry gummy that tastes like something you would actually reach for again.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flavor__grid">
      <figure class="flavor__cell flavor__cell--big">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-flavor-cutaway.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A Dandy gummy bitten in half showing its glossy berry-red centre" width="2048" height="1536" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Soft all the way through. Coarse sugar outside, glossy berry centre inside.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="flavor__cell">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-flavor-sugar.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sugar crystals landing around a Dandy gummy on a dark counter" width="2048" height="1536" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Rolled in sugar, so the first thing you taste is berry.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="flavor__cell flavor__cell--bounce">
        <div class="bounce" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'cshop-cta-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="220" height="220" loading="lazy"></div>
        <figcaption>One gummy. 35 mg mitragynine. Nothing to measure.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap ugcrow">
    <div class="ugcrow__aside"><h3>The first bite usually says it.</h3><p>Someone who has used kratom for years, tasting a Mixed Berry gummy for the first time. No chaser in the frame.</p>
      <figure class="ugcrow__still"><img src="{{ 'cshop-flavor-pull.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Berry syrup stretching between two Dandy gummies" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
    <figure class="ugc" id="ugc-01" data-slot="ugc-01" data-label="UGC-01 | First-bite flavor reaction">
      <div class="ugc__frame">
        <video class="ugc__video" playsinline muted loop preload="metadata" poster="{{ 'cshop-ugc-01-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-fallback="{{ 'cshop-flavor-cutaway.webp' | asset_url }}">
          <source src="{{ video_base }}/ugc-01.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <img class="ugc__fallback" src="{{ 'cshop-ugc-01-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" hidden>
        <div class="ugc__controls">
          <button class="ugc__btn ugc__replay" type="button" aria-label="Replay video"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5V2L7 6l5 4V7a5 5 0 1 1-5 5H5a7 7 0 1 0 7-7z"/></svg></button>
          <button class="ugc__btn ugc__sound" type="button" aria-label="Unmute video" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i-off" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4zm12.5 3l2.5-2.5-1-1L15.5 11 13 8.5l-1 1 2.5 2.5L12 14.5l1 1 2.5-2.5 2.5 2.5 1-1z"/></svg><svg class="i-on" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4zm11 3a3 3 0 0 0-1.7-2.7v5.4A3 3 0 0 0 15 12zm-1.7-6.8v2.1A5 5 0 0 1 17 12a5 5 0 0 1-3.7 4.7v2.1A7 7 0 0 0 19 12a7 7 0 0 0-5.7-6.8z"/></svg></button>
