  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. Pick your kind of day -->
<section class="days" id="days">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="days__head">
      <h2>One pouch. More than one kind of day.</h2>
      <p>Kratom is dose-dependent, which is why the same pouch can fit a morning, a workday, or a slower evening at home.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="days__row">
      <li class="day">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-day-morning.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy pouch on a kitchen counter beside coffee, keys and a sunny window" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="day__text"><h3>Get moving</h3><p>For the mornings when you want to get moving.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="day">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-day-desk.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy pouch on a desk with a notebook, keyboard and headphones" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="day__text"><h3>Stay in the lane</h3><p>For the hours when you want to stay with the thing in front of you.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="day">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-day-social.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy pouch on a picnic table with friends in the sunlit background" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="day__text"><h3>Feel a little lighter</h3><p>For making an ordinary day feel a little more Dandy.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="day">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-day-evening.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy pouch on a side table beside a book and a warm lamp" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="day__text"><h3>Settle in</h3><p>For when the day is done and your body knows it.</p></div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="days__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i class="is-on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. Mechanism -->
<section class="mech" id="mechanism">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mech__head">
      <h2>The same plant can meet you in more than one place.</h2>
      <p>Kratom is dose-dependent. Smaller amounts tend to produce energy and focus. Larger amounts lean toward body ease and relaxation. The amount is printed on the pouch, so you know what you are taking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mech__stage" data-state="lift">
      <div class="conveyor" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="conveyor__belt"></div>
        <div class="conveyor__gummy"><img src="{{ 'cshop-cta-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dial" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Explanatory dial. Not a dosing guide.">
        <button class="dial__stop" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-state="lift"><b>Lift</b><span>Smaller amounts</span></button>
        <button class="dial__stop" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-state="focus"><b>Focus</b><span>In between</span></button>
        <button class="dial__stop" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-state="settle"><b>Settle</b><span>Larger amounts</span></button>
        <span class="dial__needle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mech__note">This is an explanation, not a dosing calculator. People respond differently. Start with the amount on the pouch and see how one gummy sits with you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

