      <details><summary>How is kratom dose-dependent?</summary><p>The same plant tends to feel different at different amounts. Smaller amounts lean toward energy and focus. Larger amounts lean toward body ease and relaxation. Everyone responds a little differently, so start with the amount on the pouch and pay attention to how one gummy sits with you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How is the batch tested?</summary><p>Every batch goes to an independent lab and is tested for identity, potency, heavy metals, and microbials. The results for the current batch are posted on our lab reports page.</p></details>
