      <details><summary>What is the difference between gummies, capsules, and powder?</summary><p>Same plant, different format. Powder needs measuring and mixing and tastes bitter. Capsules skip the taste but still need water and are not much of a treat. A gummy is a fixed amount you can eat anywhere, and it tastes like mixed berry.</p></details>
